        <li><strong>Portfolio Management Services (₹50 Lakhs Minimum):</strong> Allowed more flexibility, but carried high minimum tickets and heavy tax burdens. Every time your PMS fund manager rebalances stocks, you face taxable short-term or long-term capital gains in your personal Demat account.</li>
        <li><strong>Alternative Investment Funds (₹1 Crore Minimum):</strong> Off-limits to most emerging affluent investors due to the ₹1 Crore minimum ticket and multi-year illiquid capital lock-ins.</li>
      </ul>
