        This left hundreds of thousands of affluent professionals, tech leaders, doctors, and entrepreneurs in an "orphan bracket." You had ₹10 Lakhs to ₹40 Lakhs to deploy and desired professional hedge-fund risk management, but lacked an accessible, regulated vehicle.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>SIF (Specialized Investment Funds) directly solves this problem.</strong> Introduced by SEBI and operated by top AMCs, SIF brings hedge-fund style risk mitigation to investors at a ₹10 Lakh entry point.
      </p>

