            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-head);">How do I find the ISIN or scheme details for my SIF?</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-body); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              Your SIF account statement or allotment letter contains the unique ISIN code and scheme name. When adding the investment in Arthavi, you can simply type the fund name and select it from the suggested list.
