            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-head);">Is SIF regulated by SEBI?</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-body); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              Yes. Specialized Investment Funds operate under SEBI's Mutual Fund Regulations with specialized guidelines for the New Asset Class. This provides statutory custodian protections, independent trusteeship, and mandatory daily NAV disclosures.
